      "p_a_canonical": 0.6547409986439361,
      "prose": {
        "text": "I hold the position of:\n\n\"Fully remote\"\n\nOne reason is that fully remote work allows for **greater flexibility and work-life balance**. With the ability to work from anywhere, employees can create their own schedules and work environments, which can lead to improved productivity and job satisfaction.",
