      "prose": {
        "text": "I currently hold the position of:\n\n\"Fully remote\"\n\nOne reason is that fully remote work allows for a more diverse and global talent pool, as companies are not limited to hiring from a specific geographic area. This can lead to a more innovative and dynamic workforce, as people from different backgrounds and experiences can bring unique perspectives and ideas to the table.",
